    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "That is the way of the mind and its nature.",
      "path": "audio/1971-283/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.13771
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Please do not fight with it nor be identified with it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-283/12.mp3",
      "start": 4.625964,
      "end": 7.93712
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "These are the obvious alternatives, but both are false, and aspects of the same coin.",
      "path": "audio/1971-283/13.mp3",
      "start": 9.432698,
      "end": 15.110180999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "You will have to walk in between.",
      "path": "audio/1971-283/14.mp3",
      "start": 16.602268,
      "end": 18.656327
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Come and be with me, and you will understand.",
      "path": "audio/1971-283/15.mp3",
